<section class="wrap app-hero">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow"><a href="/apps/">Apps</a></p>
    <h1>FretNinja</h1>
    <p class="app-tag">A chord is not a shape</p>
    <p class="lede">Type any chord and see every playable way to finger it across the whole neck.</p>
  </div>
  <img class="phone" src="/assets/media/fretninja-main.jpg" alt="FretNinja showing a chord's tones across the fretboard" width="320" height="696">
</section>

<section class="wrap feature">
  <img class="phone" src="/assets/media/fretninja-ghost-map.jpg" alt="The ghost map: every position of a chord's tones, with one voicing highlighted" width="300" height="652" loading="lazy">
  <div>
    <h2>The ghost map</h2>
    <p>Every place a chord's tones appear across fifteen frets, glowing at once, with one voicing lit on top. Move through the shapes and the lit grip travels while the map stays still.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap feature reverse">
  <img class="phone" src="/assets/media/fretninja-playable.jpg" alt="A list of playable voicings for a chord" width="300" height="652" loading="lazy">
  <div>
    <h2>Only shapes you can play</h2>
    <p>FretNinja generates every possibility then rejects the ones that span too far, need a fifth finger, or clash in the bass. What is left is what you would actually play.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap feature">
  <img class="phone" src="/assets/media/fretninja-voice-leading.jpg" alt="A chord progression with voicings chosen for smooth voice leading" width="300" height="652" loading="lazy">
  <div>
    <h2>Voice leading</h2>
    <p>Enter a progression and FretNinja picks the shapes that move least between chords.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap feature reverse">
  <img class="phone" src="/assets/media/fretninja-settings.jpg" alt="Instrument settings for tuning, handedness and fret count" width="300" height="652" loading="lazy">
  <div>
    <h2>Built for the instrument</h2>
    <ul class="ticks">
      <li>35 chord qualities from triads to 13ths and altered dominants</li>
      <li>slash chords with the bass note where you asked for it</li>
      <li>tunings including Standard, Drop D, DADGAD, Open G, Open D, E flat and 7-string</li>
      <li>a left-handed fretboard</li>
      <li>twelve, fifteen or eighteen frets</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap feature">
  <img class="phone" src="/assets/media/fretninja-details.jpg" alt="Detailed voicing information" width="300" height="652" loading="lazy">
  <div>
    <h2>What you get for every voicing</h2>
    <ul class="ticks">
      <li>fingering with barres marked</li>
      <li>which chord tone sits on each string</li>
      <li>the inversion and bass note</li>
      <li>string set and position</li>
      <li>a difficulty rating you can filter by</li>
    </ul>
    <p><a class="text-link" href="/apps/fretninja/review/">Watch the demo &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

